<% content_for :title, "Updates" %>
<article class="prose">
  <h1>Updates</h1>
  <p class="lede">News and announcements about carousel-o-pedia, newest first. For edits to carousel
    pages themselves, see <%= link_to "recent changes", recent_changes_path %>.</p>

  <section aria-labelledby="update-2026-11-04">
    <h2 id="update-2026-11-04">Invitations are coming <time datetime="2026-11-04">(November 4, 2026)</time></h2>
    <p>Carousel-o-pedia is a wiki for detailed carousel and carousel-animal information, and editing is
      currently invite-only. We will announce here when more invitations become available. Read the
      <%= link_to "About page", about_path %> for what we are aiming to build and the
      <%= link_to "editor guide", editor_guide_path %> to see what editing involves.</p>
  </section>
</article>
